      "principle": "Every morpheme is inherently accented (+) or unaccented (-). Stress falls on the leftmost (+) morpheme. If no (+) morpheme exists in the phrase, stress defaults to the absolute first syllable (syllable 1) of the phrase.",
      "morpheme_inventory": {
        "plus": ["vy-", "zna-", "my-", "-la", "že"],
        "minus": ["i", "ne", "po-", "u-", "nes-", "ve-", "-lo", "-li"]
